## 10. Advanced Features

### SSL/TLS Configuration

```bash
# Create listener with multiple certificates (SNI)
aws elbv2 create-listener \
  --load-balancer-arn $ALB \
  --protocol HTTPS \
  --port 443 \
  --certificates CertificateArn=$PRIMARY_CERT \
  --alpn-policy HTTP2 HTTP1.1 \
  --default-actions Type=forward,TargetGroupArn=$TG

# Add additional certificates
aws elbv2 add-listener-certificates \
  --listener-arn $LISTENER \
  --certificates CertificateArn=$SECONDARY_CERT

