## 11. Real-World Architectures

### Architecture 1: Microservices with ALB

```
Internet Users
      │
      ↓
   (Route 53)
      │
      ↓
  Application LB
  (DNS: alb....)
      │
   Listeners: 443
   Rules: Path-based
      │
  ┌───┴────┬──────────┬─────────┬────────────┐
  │         │          │         │            │
  ▼         ▼          ▼         ▼            ▼
User Svc  Pay Svc  Cart Svc  Inv Svc    Search Svc
:3001     :3002     :3003     :3004        :3005

Rules:
/users/* → User Service (port 3001)
/payments/* → Payment Service (port 3002)
