## Summary

Elastic Load Balancing provides:

✅ **High Availability** - Distribute traffic across multiple targets
✅ **Automatic Failover** - Deregister unhealthy targets
✅ **Auto-scaling** - Integrate with Auto Scaling Groups
✅ **Intelligent Routing** - ALB path/host routing, NLB flow-based
✅ **SSL/TLS Termination** - HTTPS at load balancer
✅ **Monitoring** - CloudWatch metrics and access logs
✅ **Global Reach** - Works with Route 53 for global distribution
✅ **Cost-effective** - Pay only for capacity used

